This fork corrects two persistent errors in the parent. First, the parent placed object_17 at the bedroom shelf (receptacle_8) for all hours, but that block has failed in every document that carries it (0.13 on 35 sightings across p_a7e3, p_b2d9, p_e4b7, p_8e2f, and others). The per-object statistics show object_17 is mostly at the shared desk (receptacle_12, 9/18 sighted days) and has been sighted in 8 different receptacles, making it a floating desk-area item rather than a static bedroom object. I have moved object_17 to receptacle_12 during weekday work hours and given it a lower-confidence "usually" block for the rest of the day.

